{
  "Selects a value on a track by dragging a thumb or using the keyboard. It supports a single number or a range with two thumbs, steps, labeled tick marks, a value tooltip, a vertical orientation and number formatting, along with the label, help text and validation common to all fields.": "",
  "Range slider": "",
  "With `range`, there are two thumbs and the value is `[start, end]`. The thumbs cannot cross, and `minDistance` keeps them apart. Clicking the track moves the nearest thumb.": "",
  "Centered slider": "",
  "With `origin`, the active part of the track runs from that value to the thumb in either direction. Use it for values such as balance, offset or correction.": "",
  "Steps and tick marks": "",
  "`step` sets the values a thumb stops at. `ticks` draws a mark at every step, or divides the track into that many equal parts when set to a number. `tickLabels` shows the values under the marks.": "",
  "Value tooltip and format": "",
  "`showValue` displays the value in a tooltip above the thumb, either while it moves (`drag`, which includes keyboard changes) or `always`. `format` formats it with `Intl.NumberFormat`, and `valueText` provides custom text for screen readers.": "",
  "`orientation=\"vertical\"` makes the track vertical. Up is greater, and the Up arrow moves the thumb up.": "",
  "Update timing": "",
  "By default, the value updates as the thumb is dragged. With `updateOn=\"change\"`, it updates once when the thumb is released, which is useful for work that should not run on every movement, such as a search. Keyboard changes apply immediately in both cases.": "",
  "Sizes, read-only, disabled and validation": "",
  "Increases the value by one step. On right-to-left pages, Left increases the value on a horizontal slider.": "",
  "Decreases the value by one step.": "",
  "Increases or decreases the value by `largeStep`.": "",
  "Moves to the minimum or maximum. With two thumbs, the other thumb sets the limit.": "",
  "Each thumb is a Tab stop.": "Her tutamaç bir Tab durağıdır.",
  "Sets focus on the first thumb.": "",
  "`role=\"slider\"` with `aria-valuenow`, `aria-valuemin`, `aria-valuemax` and `aria-orientation`, and `aria-valuetext` when `format` or `valueText` is set.": "",
  "A single thumb is named by the label. Two thumbs sit in a `role=\"group\"` named by the label, and each thumb is named by the label and its end (\"Minimum\", \"Maximum\").": "",
  "The `aria-valuemax` of the start thumb is the value of the end thumb, and vice versa, as the APG multi-thumb slider pattern specifies.": "",
  "`aria-readonly`, `aria-invalid` and `aria-disabled` on the thumbs. The help text describes them.": "",
  "The pointer is captured during a drag, and clicking the track moves the nearest thumb. The track is as tall as a touch target.": "",
  "The names of the two thumbs in a range come from `uiLocale.strings` (`minimum`, `maximum`). Numbers use `locale`, which defaults to the page `lang`.": "",
  "The field. `data-size`, `data-orientation`, `data-range`, `data-show-value`, `data-ticks`, `data-tick-labels`, `data-dragging`, `data-readonly`, `data-disabled`, `data-invalid`, `data-split`.": "Field. `data-size`, `data-orientation`, `data-range`, `data-show-value`, `data-ticks`, `data-tick-labels`, `data-dragging`, `data-readonly`, `data-disabled`, `data-invalid`, `data-split`.",
  "The pointer target: the track and the tick marks.": "",
  "The track and the rail that holds its segments (`--_from`, `--_to`; `data-from=\"start | thumb | origin\"`, `data-to=\"thumb | origin | end\"`, `data-start-active`, `data-end-active`).": "",
  "The active segment and the inactive segments before and after it (`data-side`).": "",
  "A thumb's pressable area (`data-thumb=\"start | end\"`, `data-dragging`, `--_at`).": "",
  "The visual parts of a thumb, centered on it: a halo, the knob and the inner part of the knob.": "",
  "The value tooltip above a thumb.": "",
  "The tick marks (`data-mark`, `data-active`, `--_at`) and their labels.": "",
  "Units: the inactive segments (`before`, `after`), the active segment (`from-start`, `to-end`) and the end dots (`active`), each with a box per state (`hover`, `focus`, `pressed`, `readonly`, `disabled`).": "",
  "Units: the visual parts of a thumb, with a box per state (`hover`, `focus`, `pressed`, `readonly`, `disabled`).": "",
  "Units: the value tooltip and its arrow, the tick marks and labels, and a ring around the whole control during keyboard use.": "",
  "The inactive and active segments, per size.": "",
  "The knob along and across the track, and its inner part, per size.": "",
  "A track split around the thumbs and the origin, and the position of its end dots.": "",
  "The height of the track for the pointer, and the touch target of a thumb.": "",
  "The length of a vertical slider.": "Dikey slider'ın uzunluğu.",
  "The position of the tick marks and their labels.": "",
  "The distance between the tooltip and its thumb, and the tooltip arrow.": "",
  "The width of a horizontal slider, the same as all fields.": "",
  "The value, or `[start, end]` with `range`. `x-model` provides two-way binding. The value is kept on a step and within the limits.": "",
  "The label. Writing `&Name` makes Alt+N move focus to the thumb. This is the same property as `text`.": "",
  "The limits. When they change, the value is adjusted and written back.": "",
  "The values a thumb stops at, counted from `min`. Use `0` for continuous values.": "",
  "The amount Page Up and Page Down move the thumb.": "",
  "Shows two thumbs, and the value is `[start, end]`. The thumbs cannot cross.": "",
  "The minimum distance between the two thumbs.": "",
  "Creates a centered slider, where the active part of the track runs from this value to the thumb in either direction. It cannot be used with `range`.": "",
  "Makes the slider vertical, with higher values at the top.": "",
  "`true` adds a mark at every step (up to 1000), and a number adds that many equal parts.": "",
  "Shows values under the marks, or at the two ends if there are no marks.": "",
  "Shows a value tooltip above the thumb: never, while it moves (with the pointer or keyboard), or always.": "",
  "The format used by the tooltip, the tick labels and screen readers.": "",
  "The locale of `format`.": "`format` için yerel ayar.",
  "The text screen readers announce for a value. Because it is a function, it is stored as is and not bound.": "",
  "With `change`, the value updates when the thumb is released. The thumb still moves during the drag.": "",
  "The name submitted with the form. A range submits two values.": "",
  "Parts common to all fields. `prefix` and `suffix` appear at the two ends of the track.": "",
  "The slider can receive focus and be read, but not moved.": "",
  "`sm`, `md` or `lg`, which set the size of the rail and the thumbs.": "",
  "The thumb elements, `[start, end]`. The end thumb is hidden without `range`.": "",
  "These work the same way as on all fields.": "",
  "Formats a value the same way as the tooltip.": "",
  "Occurs when validation finishes.": ""
}
